        "answer": {
          "short": "Mean: $24.2$ minutes; median: $17$ minutes; no mode.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{17+15+16+18+55}{5}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{121}{5}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=24.2\\text{ minutes}\\end{align*}$$\nOrdered data: $15,\\ 16,\\ 17,\\ 18,\\ 55$. The middle value is $17$, so the median is $17$ minutes. Every value occurs once, so there is no mode.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
